{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0584_1000_p", "source_sha256": "af32906859e97731b1f6735852f92225d6474063d16bc649cd56b63e392d143d", "ja": "（プロデュース企画の一環で、桃子がバレンタイン\nフェアの宣伝大使に抜擢。今日は宣伝動画の撮影だ）", "zh": "（作为制作人企划的一环，桃子被选为情人节促销活动的宣传大使。今天要拍摄宣传视频了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0584_1001_049mom", "source_sha256": "0bcd4a1fcbacd75ce941e193a057a56cb740215433fc014974f7a61ee9703307", "ja": "え、えっとね……\n今日はあなたのために、チョコを作ってきたの。", "zh": "呃、那个……\n今天我为你做了巧克力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0584_1002_049mom", "source_sha256": "25e00a4a6c7d5749d668217e827fd1e2654611c5d6418c99eddcedbe75b19492", "ja": "形は変かもしれないけど、気持ちはたっぷり込めたよ。\n……ねえ、受け取ってくれる？", "zh": "虽然形状可能有点奇怪，但我倾注了满满的心意哦。\n……呐，你愿意收下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0584_1003_p", "source_sha256": "af2ebcb77787de28dd85dcf3ca94ccb108cfe8266179347227591ad3fb5da5aa", "ja": "お疲れ様、収録バッチリだったな！　スタッフさん達も\n「いい映像になりそうだ」って喜んでたよ。", "zh": "辛苦了，录制非常顺利！工作人员们也说  \n“感觉会拍出很棒的视频”，都很高兴呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0584_1004_049mom", "source_sha256": "4e838b5065177a7825ad55b609d884073f63344e339445def4410dd811cc8dec", "ja": "ホント！\n……まあ、桃子ならこれくらいトーゼンだけど。", "zh": "真的！\n……不过，这点程度对桃子来说当然不在话下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0584_1005_p", "source_sha256": "e08ac97125bedcd1d6e63778673f794d8f7ce2683fc2a2376f938949ee068075", "ja": "もしかして、ちょっと緊張してたのか？", "zh": "难道说，你刚才有点紧张吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0584_1006_049mom", "source_sha256": "0b37dd1ad54600e4800fae31d44669df0a0ab0bc68584fee7ace6c480d46213c", "ja": "……もう、お兄ちゃん！　そういうのは、\n気づいても指摘しないのがマナーだよ！", "zh": "……真是的，大哥哥！那种事情，\n就算注意到了也不指出来才是礼貌吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0584_1007_p", "source_sha256": "facff914c81e18a9c62601673c3a4416e72e5fb7ca69dd920fa7f4f132548e77", "ja": "ははは……ごめん。そうだよな。", "zh": "哈哈哈……抱歉。确实是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0584_1008_049mom", "source_sha256": "58805c7ec94b94b7425a73d2461ef016207b8fa6722d931afe4d464482450d0d", "ja": "それに、桃子は緊張してたんじゃなくて……\n心配だったの。", "zh": "而且，桃子不是紧张……  \n是担心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0584_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "4be9cb676bcc7696d0d1224ed2333139840bfc1e7ec4c1221877d57d2604d37e", "ja": "恋とか、まだよくわからないから。\nさっきみたいな演技で、大丈夫かなって。", "zh": "因为桃子还不是很懂恋爱之类的。\n所以担心刚才那样的演技行不行得通。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0584_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c7c78bf7355f2a050fe6af1c1c5f7ade21d78bb71e2fe72706ab4d35c69a8ac8", "ja": "そういうことなら心配ないよ。\nスタッフさんも手応えを感じてたし、俺も同じだ。", "zh": "既然是这样，就不用担心了。工作人员也觉得效果不错，我也是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0584_1011_p", "source_sha256": "b560264e59c567ef3d95b093491ca7d07f6ea0ca03ed0c36be2d0e297f1e0bec", "ja": "動画を見た人も、桃子から\nチョコを貰いたいって思う人がいるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "看了视频的人，应该也会有人想从桃子那里收到巧克力吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0584_1012_049mom", "source_sha256": "06f837d1c42464ea631fb90bff81510f687813573de09635120934ce7bb54621", "ja": "ふーん、そうなんだ……。\nそれなら大丈夫かな……。", "zh": "嗯——原来是这样啊……\n那样的话，应该没问题吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0584_1013_p", "source_sha256": "531bf35b8303b80d0f9ef4c1d6f990753f7ed8a0ce9efbc43872994903099dfe", "ja": "ん？　大丈夫って、何が？", "zh": "嗯？你说的没问题，指的是什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0584_1014_049mom", "source_sha256": "c62e53f97d171c68aadb968881048f2995e6736d80a24c80924289ff13d2e0b6", "ja": "……あっ。\nえーっと……それは……うう……。", "zh": "……啊。\n那个……这个嘛……呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0584_1015_049mom", "source_sha256": "8f63ff9abd934fc914b1cbf64ceeb7b7238d103a343595791190df1963af1804", "ja": "はぁ……せっかく、\n大人っぽくサプライズで渡そうと思ったのに。", "zh": "唉……难得想成熟一点，给你一个惊喜的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0584_1016_p", "source_sha256": "0e5b5fb575790a9d528979feec425a96d0414ccc798409e84621355e22956e23", "ja": "サプライズ……ああっ！？　ごめん……。", "zh": "惊喜……啊！？抱歉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0584_1017_049mom", "source_sha256": "451ee9038f7a1e2271ba54fa767267cf96b68154560cf7b60a4d98227eeee970", "ja": "ううん、いいの。この服で、大人っぽくなったって\n思ったけど……そんなことなかったね。", "zh": "不是，没关系。这身衣服本来让我觉得自己变得更成熟了，可是……好像并没有呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0584_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "ea25cde713d72294f8fb7576ac523777aab277ec78101ecf41af1c84edc611f1", "ja": "大人っぽい作戦は失敗しちゃったけど。\n今度は桃子らしく……！", "zh": "成熟风的作战虽然失败了。\n但下次桃子会按照自己的风格来……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0584_1019_049mom", "source_sha256": "f949e81ca95cbd524b455695ff5b37a2d653309ffc8fd6ce0cb219be8862caa2", "ja": "お兄ちゃん、桃子のプレゼント受け取ってくれる？", "zh": "哥哥，你愿意收下桃子的礼物吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0584_1020", "source_sha256": "72581708f4a5c9f944f2121956fbfb746fd61b265cb305e76f64a4a968f4a7f8", "ja": "受け取る", "zh": "收下", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0584_2000_p", "source_sha256": "71b1c1cf43b98d5580f24f1d10d2025302122054bf6e4d5d3b4b6a011cb75f02", "ja": "もちろんだよ。\nありがとう、桃子。すごく嬉しいよ。", "zh": "当然。\n谢谢你，桃子。我特别开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0584_2001_049mom", "source_sha256": "5c768d66fc1ff887e0e37d6d59fb06b2bf2e5b25d647aeb82001169e861ce111", "ja": "桃子が頑張って作ったんだから、大事に食べてね。\nあとで感想を聞くから考えておくこと。いい？", "zh": "这是桃子努力做出来的，要好好品尝哦。\n我之后会问你的感想，先想好要怎么说。好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_049mom0584_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_049mom0584_2002_049mom", "source_sha256": "9b94818d75a980094ea27c5609200ab29caa7e948e5010f46e65980be419d17d", "ja": "大人っぽいサプライズは、また今度。\n次は失敗しないから、楽しみにしてていいよ♪", "zh": "成熟的惊喜，就留到下次吧。\n下次我可不会失败的，你就好好期待吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
